</tr>
</table></div>
<p>SQL makes it easy to manipulate this data using simple DML (Data Manipulation Language) Statements. For example, if we want to list down all the customers from USA then following will be the SQL query.</p>
<pre class="just-code notranslate language-sql" data-lang="sql">
SELECT * FROM CUSTOMERS WHERE country = 'USA';
</pre>
<p>This will produce the following result:</p>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table class="table table-bordered">
